# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (context: apps/web in docker-compose.yml).
# Keeps host-native node_modules (@next/swc-win32-*, lightningcss-win32-*,
# @tailwindcss/oxide-win32-*) and host build output from overlaying the Linux
# image's own `npm ci` result via `COPY . .`.
node_modules
.next
out
test-results
playwright-report
.env*
*.log
